    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on winding mountain roads using a steering wheel controller and race against the clock!<br>Challenge past lap records and aim for the top of the leaderboard\u2014can you beat the developer\u2019s best time?<br>Choose from 4 cars and 2 courses, each available in both day and night settings.<br>Transmission options include automatic and manual. Compatible with 3-pedal + H-pattern shifter setups.*\u00b9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through two courses inspired by real-world locations.<br>Master the unique handling characteristics of each of the four cars, and push for the fastest time on twisting, winding roads!<br>Compete against other players\u2019 records and climb the local leaderboard.*\u00b2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*\u00b9 Confirmed to work only with the Thrustmaster T300RS. Functionality with other steering wheel controllers or gamepads is not guaranteed.<br>*\u00b2 Leaderboard is local only. Online ranking not supported.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on winding mountain roads using a steering wheel controller and race against the clock!<br>Challenge past lap records and aim for the top of the leaderboard\u2014can you beat the developer\u2019s best time?<br>Choose from 4 cars and 2 courses, each available in both day and night settings.<br>Transmission options include automatic and manual. Compatible with 3-pedal + H-pattern shifter setups.*\u00b9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through two courses inspired by real-world locations.<br>Master the unique handling characteristics of each of the four cars, and push for the fastest time on twisting, winding roads!<br>Compete against other players\u2019 records and climb the local leaderboard.*\u00b2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*\u00b9 Confirmed to work only with the Thrustmaster T300RS. Functionality with other steering wheel controllers or gamepads is not guaranteed.<br>*\u00b2 Leaderboard is local only. Online ranking not supported.</p>",
